@startuml Taxonomia_Contextos
title FashionAI — Taxonomia das entidades por contexto delimitado\nVisão geral — entidades-chave de fai-domain/.../domain/model e dependências entre contextos (Flyway V1–V42)
!pragma layout smetana
set separator none
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  BorderColor #4A4852
  ArrowColor #4A4852
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #CBC6BE
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #EEF6FF
  BorderColor #4A4852
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEA
  BorderColor #B8A86A
}
left to right direction

package "1. Identidade & Conta" as CTX_ID {
  component "User" as User
  component "RefreshToken" as RefreshToken
  component "UserConsent" as UserConsent
  component "UserPreferences" as UserPreferences
  component "Notification" as Notification
}
package "2. Guarda-roupa & Peças" as CTX_WR {
  component "WardrobeItem" as WardrobeItem
  component "Photo" as Photo
  component "PieceUsageDiaryEntry" as PieceUsage
  component "AcervoGroup" as AcervoGroup
}
package "3. Captura adaptativa & Visão (RF4)" as CTX_CAP {
  component "CaptureSession" as CaptureSession
  component "CaptureRequest" as CaptureRequest
  component "PieceImage" as PieceImage
  component "BrandPrediction" as BrandPrediction
  component "ModelRegistryEntry" as ModelRegistry
}
package "4. Catálogo global & Busca (RF4 — Acervo & Busca Catalogada)" as CTX_CAT {
  component "Brand" as Brand
  component "CatalogProduct" as CatalogProduct
  component "CatalogVariant" as CatalogVariant
  component "CatalogImage" as CatalogImage
  component "CatalogSource" as CatalogSource
}
package "5. Esquemas & DNA de Estilo" as CTX_SCH {
  component "Scheme" as Scheme
  component "SchemeItem" as SchemeItem
  component "DailyLook" as DailyLook
  component "WeekPlan" as WeekPlan
  component "DnaScheme" as DnaScheme
  component "StyleDna" as StyleDna
}
package "6. Social" as CTX_SOC {
  component "Follow" as Follow
  component "Comment" as Comment
  component "Reaction" as Reaction
  component "SavedItem" as SavedItem
}
package "7. Marcas, Celebridades, Selos & Cupons" as CTX_BR {
  component "BrandProfile" as BrandProfile
  component "CelebrityProfile" as CelebrityProfile
  component "Seal" as Seal
  component "SealBond" as SealBond
  component "Promotion" as Promotion
  component "CouponRight" as CouponRight
}
package "8. Meu Quarto, Pontos, Desafios & FLAIR" as CTX_ROOM {
  component "RoomLayout" as RoomLayout
  component "RoomCatalogItem" as RoomCatalogItem
  component "FaiPointsLedgerEntry" as FaiPoints
  component "ChallengeInstance" as ChallengeInstance
  component "FlairCombination" as FlairCombination
  component "FlairMatch" as FlairMatch
}
package "9. Provador, 3D & Avatar" as CTX_3D {
  component "UserAvatar3d" as UserAvatar3d
  component "RenderJobLog" as RenderJobLog
}
package "10. IA & Governança" as CTX_AI {
  component "AiInferenceLog" as AiInferenceLog
  component "ModerationQueueItem" as ModerationQueue
  component "ItemEmbedding" as ItemEmbedding
}
package "11. Infra & Operação" as CTX_OPS {
  component "AuditLog" as AuditLog
  component "PipelineJob" as PipelineJob
  component "ProcessingJobLog" as ProcessingJobLog
  component "BackupRecord" as BackupRecord
}
package "12. HypeScore v2 (RF46) — V31, V39, V41" as CTX_HYPE {
  component "HypeSignalDaily" as HypeSignalDaily
  component "HypeScoreCurrent" as HypeScoreCurrent
  component "HypeScoreSnapshot" as HypeScoreSnapshot
  component "HypeMilestone" as HypeMilestone
}
package "13. FashionAI Lens (RF45) — V40" as CTX_LENS {
  component "LensScan" as LensScan
  component "LensDetection" as LensDetection
  component "LensFeedback" as LensFeedback
}

WardrobeItem ..> CatalogProduct : catalogProductId /\ncatalogVariantId (V30)
WardrobeItem --> Brand : brand (N:1)
WardrobeItem --> User : user (N:1)
CaptureSession ..> WardrobeItem : pieceId
PieceImage ..> WardrobeItem : pieceId
SchemeItem --> WardrobeItem : wardrobeItem (N:1)
Scheme --> User : user (N:1)
Follow --> User : follower / following
SealBond --> Scheme : scheme (N:1)
BrandProfile --> User : owner (1:1)
Brand --> BrandProfile : brandProfile (N:1)
CouponRight ..> Promotion : sourceId (SELO)
CouponRight ..> FlairCombination : sourceId (FLAIR)
RoomCatalogItem ..> User : creatorUserId / maisonBrandUserId\n(marca/celebridade)
PieceUsage ..> Scheme : schemeId
UserAvatar3d --> User : user (1:1)
PipelineJob --> User : user (N:1)
WardrobeItem ..> PipelineJob : processingJobId
ItemEmbedding ..> WardrobeItem : entityId (HypeEntityType)
HypeSignalDaily ..> WardrobeItem : entityId (PIECE)
HypeScoreCurrent ..> Scheme : entityId (SCHEME)
HypeScoreSnapshot ..> HypeScoreCurrent : mesma (entityType, entityId)
HypeMilestone ..> Notification : notificationId
LensScan ..> User : userId
LensScan ..> AiInferenceLog : aiInferenceId
LensDetection ..> LensScan : scanId
LensDetection ..> WardrobeItem : ownedItemId («Eu tenho»)
LensFeedback ..> LensDetection : detectionId
note "HypeScore v1 removido em P3-16: as entidades\nHypeScoreMetric, HypeGroup e MetricSnapshot e o enum\nHypeScoreBand saíram do código (tabelas antigas ficam\nno banco só como histórico). V42: UserPreferences\n.hypeCreatorOptOut tira a pessoa de «Criadores em alta»." as N_V1
N_V1 .. HypeScoreCurrent
legend right
  Seta cheia = associação JPA (@ManyToOne/@OneToOne) · tracejada = id guardado sem FK JPA.
  Detalhe de cada área: docs/diagramas/fashionai-classes-v5-*.puml (PNG FashionAI_Classes_v5_<Área>).
endlegend
@enduml
